{
 "id": "M3-reconcile-refused-root",
 "note": "MOD-SPEC §1.2 unsafe roots, §2.5 content-free rows, §5.4 (reconcile <= 2 s): while handoff_root is refused (inside a git work tree, not ignored), PostCompact with a proven main summary logs one failed copy row and keeps the stash; Stops under the refused root do not retry the save (no extra copy row per Stop); a Stop with a safe root saves the stash late. A summary with no scope proof (ROOT-RULINGS F2-1) is only stashed: refused Stops leave it, and the safe Stop saves it as unattributed",
